(2) scheme independence of the anomaly-sector log coefficient on the cone:
   KS (S^4 frame) log coefficient on the cone: -(v - 1)**3*(v + 3)/(4*v)
   ESU Riegert anomaly log coeff: (v**2 + 1)/v ; (1/288pi^2) int R^2 log coeff: (v - 1)**2*(v + 1)**2/(4*v)
   ESU - R2 - KS = 2   (should be 0 for scheme independence)
   KS coefficient minus its regular value (v=1): -(v - 1)**3*(v + 3)/(4*v)
   [anomaly-sector part of the note's coefficient: (v-1)^2/v - (v^2-1)^2/(4v) = -(v - 1)**3*(v + 3)/(4*v) ]
(3) note's smoothing family: a(0)= 0  a'(0)= 1  a''(0)= (v - 1)/delta
